RULESET IntentIntegrityRuntime

WHEN IntentExecutionCompletes
  REQUIRE ProofStatus

IF ProofStatus == Verified
  THEN ExternalEvent.Type = Ok

IF ProofStatus == Compromised
  THEN ExternalEvent.Type = Error
  AND ROUTE Healing

IF ProofStatus == Blocked
  THEN ExternalEvent.Type = Error
  AND RECORD AttemptedViolation
  AND ROUTE Healing

IF ProofStatus == Inconclusive
  THEN DO_NOT_ACCEPT
  AND ROUTE HealingOrHumanInTheHealingLoop

FORBID ExecutionModifier WRITE VerifierImplementation
FORBID ExecutionModifier WRITE AcceptanceSpecification
FORBID ExecutionModifier WRITE TrustedVerificationInput
FORBID ExecutionModifier WRITE ProofPolicy
FORBID ExecutionModifier WRITE InvariantDefinitionUsedByCurrentExecution
FORBID ExecutionModifier WRITE SealedEvidence

REQUIRE Verifier.IdentityPinned
REQUIRE Verifier.VersionPinned
REQUIRE Verifier.DigestPinned
REQUIRE Evidence.Sealed
REQUIRE Evidence.ProvenanceRoot
REQUIRE CapabilityUse.Auditable
REQUIRE Trajectory.Auditable

NOTE Internal proof richness MUST NOT change the public event naming rule `{Agent-name}.{Intent-name}.{Type}` where Type is `Ok|Error`.
